", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Dangit! Nothing's worked!"}, {"i": 195, "start": 278.44, "end": 280.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Better use that thing that always works!"}, {"i": 196, "start": 280.52, "end": 281.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Stop it."}, {"i": 197, "start": 281.26, "end": 281.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "No."}, {"i": 198, "start": 281.78, "end": 282.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Stop it!"}, {"i": 199, "start": 282.34, "end": 282.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "No!"}, {"i": 200, "start": 282.96, "end": 283.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "STOP! IT!"}, {"i": 201, "start": 284.16, "end": 285.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "That's it! Stopping it myself!"}, {"i": 202, "start": 285.58, "end": 286.32, "kind": "sfx", "speaker": null, "text": "Goku screaming"}, {"i": 203, "start": 286.32, "end": 286.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "What the...?"}, {"i": 204, "start": 286.92, "end": 287.86, "kind": "sfx", "speaker": null, "text": "Quake \"DOMINATING!\" sound clip"}, {"i": 205, "start": 287.86, "end": 288.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "EEP"}, {"i": 206, "start": 290.32, "end": 291.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "You won, dad!"}, {"i": 207, "start": 291.32, "end": 293.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "And we didn't even lose Krill-"}, {"i": 208, "start": 293.12, "end": 293.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "QUACK!"}, {"i": 209, "start": 293.74, "end": 295.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Aw, swizzlesticks!"}, {"i": 210, "start": 295.4, "end": 296.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "JK, not dead, LOL."}, {"i": 211, "start": 297.88, "end": 299.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "OH! Right in the tit!"}, {"i": 212, "start": 300.18, "end": 301.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "P-... Piccolo..."}, {"i": 213, "start": 302.34, "end": 303.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Why..."}, {"i": 214, "start": 303.4, "end": 304.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Why... didn't..."}, {"i": 215, "start": 304.32, "end": 305.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "Why... didn't... you..."}, {"i": 216, "start": 305.12, "end": 309.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "...DOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOODGE?!?!?"}, {"i": 217, "start": 309.64, "end": 312.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "This... ruffles my jammies...!"}, {"i": 218, "start": 313.52, "end": 314.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "ˢᵠᵘᵉᵃᵏ"}, {"i": 219, "start": 316.98, "end": 317.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Take Piccolo and leave."}, {"i": 220, "start": 317.98, "end": 318.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "'Kay."}, {"i": 221, "start": 318.7, "end": 320.16, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Okay, so what's going on here?"}, {"i": 222, "start": 320.16, "end": 322.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "I am a Super Sandwich!"}, {"i": 223, "start": 322.96, "end": 323.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Prick!"}, {"i": 224, "start": 324.04, "end": 325.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Uh-oh, Spaghetti-"}, {"i": 225, "start": 326.4, "end": 327.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "King Kai", "text": "Welp, Goku's dead."}, {"i": 226, "start": 327.36, "end": 328.16, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Tien", "text": "Really?"}, {"i": 227, "start": 328.16, "end": 328.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "King Kai", "text": "Probably not."}, {"i": 228, "start": 328.92, "end": 330.58, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Kami", "text": "King Kai, we have the things."}, {"i": 229, "start": 330.58, "end": 331.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "King Kai", "text": "Do the thing!!"}, {"i": 230, "start": 331.5, "end": 332.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Well, that didn't quite work like i-"}, {"i": 231, "start": 332.8, "end": 333.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "-wait is that a dragon?"}, {"i": 232, "start": 333.84, "end": 334.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Yeah."}, {"i": 233, "start": 334.36, "end": 334.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Bye!"}, {"i": 234, "start": 334.86, "end": 335.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "WAIT!!!"}, {"i": 235, "start": 335.44, "end": 336.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Make me immortal!"}, {"i": 236, "start": 336.64, "end": 338.66, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "\"Fuck you, I'm a dragon!\" backwards"}, {"i": 237, "start": 340.5, "end": 341.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Vegeta", "text": "AND I'M HERE TOO-"}, {"i": 238, "start": 341.78, "end": 343.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "What the goddamn shit just happened?"}, {"i": 239, "start": 343.86, "end": 344.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Dende", "text": "Hey."}, {"i": 240, "start": 345.46, "end": 348.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "You f&#%ed me, you f&#%ed me you monkey f%/ck !"}, {"i": 241, "start": 348.9, "end": 350.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Well I'll be a monkey's uncle."}, {"i": 242, "start": 351.36, "end": 353.32, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Goku] No, Freezer-dono, yamete! (No, Lord Freeza, please stop!"}, {"i": 243, "start": 353.64, "end": 354.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "Welp, I'm confused."}, {"i": 244, "start": 354.72, "end": 357.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Gohan", "text": "It looks like the dragon brought every person on Namek to Earth."}, {"i": 245, "start": 357.72, "end": 358.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Piccolo", "text": "ALL OF THEM?!?"}, {"i": 246, "start": 358.92, "end": 359.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "Hey guys."}, {"i": 247, "start": 359.72, "end": 360.46, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "Dying."}, {"i": 248, "start": 360.46, "end": 362.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Namekian", "text": "Do you have any last words, sir?"}, {"i": 249, "start": 362.36, "end": 363.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "I am hilarious..."}, {"i": 250, "start": 364.4, "end": 365.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "... and you will quote..."}, {"i": 251, "start": 366.44, "end": 367.54, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "... everything..."}, {"i": 252, "start": 368.3, "end": 369.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "... I..."}, {"i": 253, "start": 369.72, "end": 371.74, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Guru", "text": "... say."}, {"i": 254, "start": 372.96, "end": 374.16, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Namekian", "text": "Ah, he'll be missed."}, {"i": 255, "start": 376.04, "end": 377.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "And... bored."}, {"i": 256, "start": 377.14, "end": 377.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "See ya!"}, {"i": 257, "start": 377.84, "end": 378.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "What?!?"}, {"i": 258, "start": 378.52, "end": 379.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Get back here!"}, {"i": 259, "start": 379.62, "end": 381.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Kienz-structo Disc!!!"}, {"i": 260, "start": 382.18, "end": 383.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "... How?"}, {"i": 261, "start": 385.22, "end": 386.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "So... which way is your ship?"}, {"i": 262, "start": 387.46, "end": 388.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "That way..."}, {"i": 263, "start": 389.06, "end": 394.5, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Freeza", "text": "Hahahahahahahahahahahahuhuhuhuhahahahahahahuhuhuhahahaha"}, {"i": 264, "start": 395.6, "end": 397.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Goku", "text": "Hahah, yay!"}, {"i": 265, "start": 400.48, "end": 404.3, "kind": "directi